{"slug":"smart-button","title":"Smart Button","desc":"The Smart Button is a wearable panic button that uses Bluetooth technology to communicate with our smartphone app to raise a SOS alarm in an emergency.","og":"https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/smartbutton.png","content":"<!-- wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/hero {\"label\":\"Bluetooth Panic Button\",\"title\":\"Bluetooth Smart Button\",\"intro\":\"The Smart Button is a discreet, compact and wearable mobile panic button that can be worn on the wrist like a watch or attached via a keyring. Using Bluetooth technology, the Smart Button communicates with our mobile app to raise a SOS alarm in an emergency.\",\"buttons\":[{\"linkText\":\"Book a Demo\",\"link\":\"\",\"linkTarget\":false,\"dialog\":\"demo-dialog\",\"variant\":\"\"}],\"imageId\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/smartbutton.png@@\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/trustpilot-widget {\"widget\":\"horizontal\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Features</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Leading safety technology</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Connects to the Peoplesafe mobile app via Bluetooth connectivity</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>The button overrides your smartphone’s keypad lock with a simple press</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>No need to charge, works via a CR2032 watch battery</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Battery usually lasts for a year and battery life info can be viewed in the app’s menu</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Works with Android and iPhone smartphones</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/text-and-media {\"title\":\"Emergency response faster than 999\",\"mediaType\":\"video\",\"videoUrl\":\"https://vimeo.com/841920708\"} -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Your employees are protected 24/7/365 by our dedicated Alarm Receiving Centre (ARC). We provide the quickest response in an emergency.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>3 seconds to pick up alarms</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>4 minute police response in threat-to-life situations</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>100% service uptime</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n<!-- /wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/text-and-media -->\n\n<!-- wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/text-and-media {\"title\":\"Hands-free personal safety\",\"imageId\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/smartbutton-tab1.png@@\",\"framed\":false,\"mediaPosition\":\"left\"} -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The Smart Button works directly in conjunction with our <a href=\"/products/lone-worker-app/\">lone working app</a>, which can easily be downloaded from the App and Play Stores. A simple press of the Smart Button is all it takes to override the keypad lock on your phone and raise an alarm.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>In certain situations, you will need to discreetly signal for help without alerting an aggressor. The Smart Button allows you to do this through its Bluetooth connection with the app.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Once a <a href=\"/uk/panic-alarms/\">panic alarm</a> is raised, your GPS coordinates will be sent to the Peoplesafe <a href=\"/alarm-receiving-centre/\">Alarm Receiving Centre (ARC)</a> using the smartphone’s GPS capabilities, so our Controllers can send the emergency services directly to you.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- /wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/text-and-media -->\n\n<!-- wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/faq {\"title\":\"Smart Button FAQs\",\"faqs\":[{\"question\":\"What is the Peoplesafe Smart Button?\",\"answer\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eThe Peoplesafe Smart Button is a discreet, compact and wearable panic button that connects to the Peoplesafe mobile app using Bluetooth. It can be worn on the wrist like a watch or attached to a keyring, giving employees a simple way to raise an SOS alarm in an emergency.\\u003c/p\\u003e\"},{\"question\":\"How does the Peoplesafe Smart Button work?\",\"answer\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eThe Smart Button connects to the Peoplesafe mobile app via Bluetooth. When the button is pressed, it can override the smartphone’s keypad lock and raise an alarm without the user needing to unlock or operate their phone.\\u003c/p\\u003e\"},{\"question\":\"Can the Smart Button be used to raise an alarm discreetly?\",\"answer\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eYes. The Smart Button allows a user to raise an SOS alarm without having to visibly operate their smartphone. This can be particularly useful when someone needs to signal for help without drawing attention to what they are doing.\\u003c/p\\u003e\"},{\"question\":\"What happens when the Smart Button is pressed?\",\"answer\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eWhen an alarm is raised, the user’s GPS coordinates are sent through the smartphone to the Peoplesafe Alarm Receiving Centre (ARC). An Alarm Controller can then assess the situation and arrange the appropriate response, including contacting the emergency services when required.\\u003c/p\\u003e\"},{\"question\":\"Does the Peoplesafe Smart Button need to be charged?\",\"answer\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eNo. The Smart Button uses a CR2032 watch battery rather than a rechargeable battery. The battery will usually last for around one year, and its remaining battery life can be viewed through the Peoplesafe app.\\u003c/p\\u003e\"},{\"question\":\"Which smartphones are compatible with the Smart Button?\",\"answer\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eThe Peoplesafe Smart Button works with both Android smartphones and iPhones when used with the Peoplesafe mobile app.\\u003c/p\\u003e\"}]} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/cta-banner {\"theme\":\"orange\",\"title\":\"Interested in the Smart Button?\",\"content\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eWhen paired with our lone worker app, the Smart Button provides a wearable device to utilise the Peoplesafe service. Get in touch with us today for a consultation.\\u003c/p\\u003e\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/related-content {\"title\":\"Related Products\",\"items\":[{\"type\":\"product\",\"id\":\"@@prod:lone-worker-app@@\"}]} /-->","menu_order":17,"types":["accessories"]}